  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 13795856384
    m_Localized: 'Glad you made it here as well! This place sure is strange, I''ve
      never seen anything like it. '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 16597651456
    m_Localized: Not that I have seen that many things in general, being without
      eyes...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19114233856
    m_Localized: 'Anyways, even this place is unfortunately filled with those hostile
      rocks. '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 143846296976003072
    m_Localized: 'If you have any Astral Pigments left, now would be a great time
      to spend it!  '
